Awesome Grok Bot Templates — licence summary
============================================

Compilation, scripts and README text written for this list
    Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.
    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
    The build script (scripts/build.mjs) may alternatively be used under the MIT License.

Catalog rows (catalog.json, categories/*.md, README listings)
    Facts — a bot's name, its x.ai share link, who shared it, category and whether the link
    works — are not copyrightable and are free to use.

    Descriptive text keeps the licence of the catalog it came from, recorded per row in
    catalog.json as `license`, with attribution in the row's `sources` array:

      CC0-1.0     No conditions.
      CC-BY-4.0   Attribution required (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
                  Carry the row's `sources` forward when you reuse its text.
      facts-only  Name and description read from the creator's own public x.ai share page.

    Upstream catalogs: kydlikebtc/awesome-grokbot, majiayu000/awesome-grok-bot,
    cs68614-hash/awesome-grokbot-templates (CC0); GrokBot.dev (ZeroPointRepo/GrokBotDev) and
    GrokBot HQ (https://grokbothq.xyz) (CC BY 4.0); dajiaohuang/awesome-grok-bot-templates.

The bots themselves
    Every bot belongs to its creator. This list links to public x.ai share pages and does not
    host, copy or redistribute any bot configuration or prompt.
